{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\nRestaurant settings\n\nScreen size, channels and the identity printed on reports and bills.\n\nTerminal screen size\n\nThe size POS, KDS, Captain and Kiosk screens open at. Someone at a terminal can still pick a different size for that screen.\n\n70%\n150%\n100%\n\n· Applies to all terminals of this restaurant\n\nSave changes\nReport branding & legal profile\n\nRestaurant identity used on End of Day (EOD) Z-Reports, GST tax invoices, and thermal bills. Applies to this restaurant on every terminal.\n\nSave changes\nBusiness date rollover\n00:00 restaurant time\n01:00 restaurant time\n02:00 restaurant time\n03:00 restaurant time\n04:00 restaurant time\n05:00 restaurant time\n06:00 restaurant time\n07:00 restaurant time\n08:00 restaurant time\n09:00 restaurant time\n10:00 restaurant time\n11:00 restaurant time\n12:00 restaurant time\n13:00 restaurant time\n14:00 restaurant time\n15:00 restaurant time\n16:00 restaurant time\n17:00 restaurant time\n18:00 restaurant time\n19:00 restaurant time\n20:00 restaurant time\n21:00 restaurant time\n22:00 restaurant time\n23:00 restaurant time\nRestaurant timezone\n\nOrders before this hour belong to the previous business date. This never counts cash or closes a register. Owner sign-in and a successful server save are required; terminals receive the setting on their next profile refresh.\n\nBranch operating profile\n\nSelected branch: current rollover 05:00 in Asia/Kolkata. Changes start tomorrow in the current restaurant timezone.\n\nFollow restaurant defaults\n\nPreview: Use the restaurant timezone and rollover rule, including future default changes.\n\nApply branch profile\nRefresh device acknowledgement\nUI Audit POS: Profile acknowledged · online\nUI Audit POS_ADMIN: Profile acknowledged · online\nBrand preview\nUI Audit Restaurant A\n\nAhmedabad\n\nOrder preview\n\nPreview shows unsaved edits. Saving publishes the branding profile; device acknowledgement is shown separately above.\n\nShow JAMAN AI Assistant\nControls JAMAN AI visibility in Restaurant Admin, POS, Captain, KDS and Kiosk. Platform access is granted separately by your plan or Super Admin.\n\nPlatform access: Enabled\n\nRefresh assistant access\nLIVE DOCUMENT HEADER PREVIEW:\nUI AUDIT RESTAURANT A\n, Ahmedabad,\nGSTIN: • FSSAI:\nPhone: • Email:\n1. Restaurant Identity & Trade Names\nRestaurant Trade / Brand Name:\nUsed in customer apps, bills & headings\nLegal Registered Entity Name:\nUsed on GST Invoices & official EOD Reports\nBrand Tagline / Slogan:\nRestaurant Logo Asset Path / URL:\nReset\n2. Statutory Tax & Regulatory Credentials\nGSTIN Number (15 Digits):\nOptional — leave blank if not GST-registered\nFSSAI License Number (14 Digits):\nMSME / Udyam Number (Optional):\n3. Address & Geographical Location\nStreet Address:\nCity:\nState & Pincode:\n4. Contact Channels & Website\nContact Phone:\nContact Email:\nOfficial Website URL:\n5. Signatories & Printed Statement Footer\nRestaurant Owner Name:\nFloor Manager Name:\nReport Footer Closing Remark:\nSave & Apply Across All Reports\nJAMAN AI",
